{"id":"116befd67ce6228f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-priority.md","title":"优先构造的需求与损伤记录","display":"df-priority — 优先构造的需求与损伤记录","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-priority","aliases":["20-df-priority"],"display":"df-priority — 优先构造的需求与损伤记录","chapter":"7","section":"7.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§7.1；阶段记录的本地形式化","source_pdf_pages":[181],"source_printed_pages":[147],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-priority"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-priority</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-priority — 优先构造的需求与损伤记录"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§7.1；阶段记录的本地形式化"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>181</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>147</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为记录候选；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin\\omega\">\\(\\bot\\notin\\omega\\)</span> 为固定的无行动标记；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。用于记录分量的变量满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(S\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in(\\omega\\cup\\{\\bot\\})^\\omega\">\\(a\\in(\\omega\\cup\\{\\bot\\})^\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(I\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 编码阶段有限状态，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 记录行动需求，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 记录损伤阶段。有效性及优先顺序条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}\">\\(\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}\\)</span> 的定义给出；不额外要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nI_i((S,a,I)):=\\{s\\in\\omega:(i,s)\\in I\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists S\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists a\\in(\\omega\\cup\\{\\bot\\})^\\omega\\ \\exists I\\subseteq\\omega^2\\\n\\Bigl[C=(S,a,I)\\land\\chi_I^{(2)}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\\\n\\land\\forall i,s\\in\\omega\\ [(i,s)\\in I\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ (e&lt;i\\land a(s)=e)]\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nI_i((S,a,I)):=\\{s\\in\\omega:(i,s)\\in I\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists S\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists a\\in(\\omega\\cup\\{\\bot\\})^\\omega\\ \\exists I\\subseteq\\omega^2\\\n\\Bigl[C=(S,a,I)\\land\\chi_I^{(2)}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\\\n\\land\\forall i,s\\in\\omega\\ [(i,s)\\in I\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ (e&lt;i\\land a(s)=e)]\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每种实际构造必须另外说明什么时候旧计算或参数被破坏、如何记入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>、如何初始化，以及每个需求的数学目标。这个定义只给有限状态、优先序和损伤的共同签名，不把“优先方法”当作自动满足全部需求的黑箱定理。</p>\n<p>来源：§7.1；阶段记录的本地形式化；印刷页 147；PDF 第 181 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in(\\omega\\cup\\{\\bot\\})^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}priority}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nI_i((S,a,I)):=\\{s\\in\\omega:(i,s)\\in I\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PriorityRecord}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists S\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists a\\in(\\omega\\cup\\{\\bot\\})^\\omega\\ \\exists I\\subseteq\\omega^2\\\n\\Bigl[C=(S,a,I)\\land\\chi_I^{(2)}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\\\n\\land\\forall i,s\\in\\omega\\ [(i,s)\\in I\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ (e<i\\land a(s)=e)]\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1943,"backlinks":[{"id":"423b4c2674336774","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-priority]]。"},{"id":"923d91c3e419d09b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-priority]]。"},{"id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"5d6ac440f71a3538","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-fininjury]]。"}],"outgoing":["e343870c773cb68e","4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","de14d8d6c42250de"]}